{"agent_id":"pp3g-KaeS-open-ended-architectural-review-on-issue-371-read-the","agent_seq":1,"timestamp":"2026-08-14T23:48:34.445334773Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7f7e94d0-69aa-4652-a90b-08861205b3d2","comment_uuid":"2e41b3ad-adf6-4b5d-945a-28124f39a10e","author":"pp3g-KaeS-open-ended-architectural-review-on-issue-371-read-the","content":"Plan: independent architectural review of the Tools/monorepo drift architecture. (1) Verify drift evidence against local ASES worktree (hook-config precedence, plugin sizes, gitignore'd .claude, model whitelist staleness, .ases status). (2) Evaluate the five mandate questions (a)-(e) with evidence. (3) Post verdict as --kind result on this sub-issue only. Read-only; no file changes, no commits.","created_at":"2026-08-14T23:48:34.439469083Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:prHqb5uo8bgYse0dKjeDZfRi7JuMFttOHgot8Aj7KZo","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAghZRxLQOWt+gccT/3usNxuUm9XO7Mz+NXaeh1UiCXJG4AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAzZw/Qokkn1HIQQhs2AS1cDM8Nt/MtsGnWLkT/Ar1CEkCy4F6h4Shy9uQYPPaE4orRrDc67eGudqjV9OlHvSyAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:prHqb5uo8bgYse0dKjeDZfRi7JuMFttOHgot8Aj7KZo","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAghZRxLQOWt+gccT/3usNxuUm9XO7Mz+NXaeh1UiCXJG4AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLULjSJ2y6IoKQSxcGjol2Zq1vxsxT98mO05xDX+7uy+xC5lhVb2h3UAHHt3G406jFObjUvpsWm6//gjD6DPiw0="}
